   \[
   \frac{3}{2i} \int_{-\infty}^{\infty} \left( e^{i(2\pi - \omega)t} - e^{-i(2\pi + \omega)t} \right) dt
   \]
   Evaluating the integral:
   \[
   \frac{3}{2i} \left[ \frac{e^{i(2\pi - \omega)t}}{i(2\pi - \omega)} - \frac{e^{-i(2\pi + \omega)t}}{i(-(2\pi + \omega))} \right] \Bigg|_{-\infty}^{\infty}
