Consider a function $g$ defined such that $g(3x) = 4g(x)$ for all positive real values of $x$, and $g(x) = 2 - 2|x - 2|$ for $1 \leq x \leq 3$. Find the smallest $x$ for which $g(x) = g(1458)$.<end_of_turn>
