How does the Coriolis Effect influence large-scale ocean currents such as the Gulf Stream and the Kuroshio current? Analyze the underlying physics principles and provide a quantitative explanation of the direction and magnitude of the currents' deflection due to the Coriolis Effect.<end_of_turn>
